ime, and you have left whatever We bestowed upon you behind you. And We do not see with you your 'intercessors' which you claimed that they were among you associates [of Allāh]. It has [all] been severed between you, and lost from you is what you used to claim.\"","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":94,"sd":null}],"juz":7,"hizb":14,"surahs":[6],"sajdah":false}